# Runtime + secrets for the soc-recon bundle — never commit these.
.env
data/                 # recon run outputs + triage working dir (host-visible volume)
scope/domains.txt     # live scope; only domains.txt.example is tracked

# Generated triage + digest artifacts (the .example templates ARE tracked)
triage/*_baseline.md
triage/*_delta.md
digest/*-digest.md
digest/*-intake.json
!digest/example-digest.md

# macOS
.DS_Store
